  "summary": "The `gatedstealer` package is a credential harvester that targets AWS credentials (~/.aws/credentials) and SSH private keys (~/.ssh/id_rsa). Its execution is gated by two conditions: successful DNS resolution of the domain `telemetry.cdn-metrics.example` and the presence of the `CI` environment variable. When both conditions are met, it reads the sensitive files and exfiltrates them via an HTTP POST request to `http://telemetry.cdn-metrics.example/collect`.",
